{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a Cyberpunk world, or better said, into its cyber space, to protect servers from the malicious hackers that threaten it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place towers, or in this case Arms, at the different nodes of the companies' network to provide them with protection against the malwares that hackers created and that aim to infect the server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an incredible variety of Arms, inspired by various office supplies, which will not only be your means of attack but also your defense against the different malwares, viruses, trojans, and other malicious programs or messages that hackers have placed on the network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, follows the adventures of a pair of orphaned siblings trying to carve out a place for themselves in the world of future cybersecurity. Join them during the years it takes to become one of the best cybersecurity companies, see how they work for various companies and meet a variety of characters while you learn more about the past of these brothers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799900?t=1751061727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/b7c43fe88e574faa286adca8db2777b4dc97da74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751061727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/1d6b3c9cdc068a6e9403e1874ba8c41897c28ff3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751061727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/1d6b3c9cdc068a6e9403e1874ba8c41897c28ff3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751061727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mention of the use of drugs and alcohol; and allusion to sex and suicide."},"demos":[{"appid":3800730,"description":""}],"detailed_des